	"data": "Concept: Non-Linear Editor (Writing Tool)\n\nWhat It Is\nA recurring concept for a writing tool that abandons the linear document model. Instead of a top-to-bottom word processor, this is a spatial/graph-based editor where narrative elements, scenes, and notes exist as nodes that can be traversed in any order.\n\nAppears across multiple ChatGPT eras, consistently tied to the [[projects/rescue-narrative]] fiction project — because the Rescue story seems to want non-linear structure that a standard…",
